eat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hello.\" title=\"Hello.\">Hello.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_novel_about_Russian_Gulags.\" title=\"A novel about Russian Gulags.\">A novel about Russian Gulags.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Stuck in a mammal groove.</strong></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_barrel_dad.\" title=\"The barrel dad.\">The barrel dad.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stay_humble.\" title=\"Stay humble.\">Stay humble.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rock_%27n%27_roll_umlaut.\" title=\"Rock &#39;n&#39; roll umlaut.\">Rock 'n' roll umlaut.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/This_is_Trevor.\" title=\"This is Trevor.\">This is Trevor.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aquatic_sewing_machine.\" title=\"Aquatic sewing machine.\">Aquatic sewing machine.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/I%27ve_been_a_bit_ill.\" title=\"I&#39;ve been a bit ill.\">I've been a bit ill.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Clumpy_swayey_clumsy_man.\" title=\"Clumpy swayey clumsy man.\">Clumpy swayey clumsy man.</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Stuck in a mammal groove.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/3/30/Stuck_in_a_mammal_groove..png/revision/latest?cb=20210212034309\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Stuck in a mammal groove.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/3/30/Stuck_in_a_mammal_groove..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210212034309\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/3/30/Stuck_in_a_mammal_groove..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210212034309 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/3/30/Stuck_in_a_mammal_groove..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210212034309 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Stuck in a mammal groove.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Stuck_in_a_mammal_groove..png\" data-image-name=\"Stuck in a mammal groove..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_8\" title=\"Series 8\">8</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lou_Sanders\" title=\"Lou Sanders\">Lou Sanders</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_novel_about_Russian_Gulags.\" title=\"A novel about Russian Gulags.\">A novel about Russian Gulags.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_barrel_dad.\" title=\"The barrel dad.\">The barrel dad.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Stuck in a mammal groove.</b></i> is the third episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_8\" title=\"Series 8\">Series 8</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 22 May 2019. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Lou_Sanders\" title=\"Lou Sanders\">Lou Sanders</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Notes</b></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Stuck_in_a_mammal_groove.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Stuck in a mammal groove\" was how <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> described <a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Thomas\" title=\"Joe Thomas\">Joe Thomas</a>' difficulties during the <a href=\"/wiki/Work_out_what_Alex_Horne_is_wearing_next_door\" title=\"Work out what Alex Horne is wearing next door\">Work out what Alex Horne is wearing next door</a> task. The title card is a close-up of the cow on <a href=\"/wiki/Sian_Gibson\" title=\"Sian Gibson\">Sian Gibson</a>'s volcano in the <a href=\"/wiki/Build_the_best_volcano\" title=\"Build the best volcano\">Build the best volcano</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Stuck_in_a_mammal_groove.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Fanget i en pattedyrsskure', which translates as 'Trapped in a mammal shed'. The compound word 'pattedyrsskure' isn't one that's used in Danish, but its component words 'pattedyrs' and 'skure' mean 'mammal' and 'shed', respectively. Presumably they were trying to convey the same idea of being stuck on a certain train of thought.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Jumittaa nisäkäsurassa', which translates as 'Stuck in a mammal rut'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Fast i pattedyrstralten', which translates as 'Stuck in a mammal habit'. The word 'pattedyr' means 'mammal', and 'tralten' is an uncommon word meaning 'the habit'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Stuck_in_a_mammal_groove.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Iain_Stirling\" title=\"Iain Stirling\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Iain Stirling</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Thomas\" title=\"Joe Thomas\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Joe Thomas</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Lou_Sanders\" title=\"Lou Sanders\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Lou Sanders</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Paul_Sinha\" title=\"Paul Sinha\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Paul Sinha</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sian_Gibson\" title=\"Sian Gibson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sian Gibson</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_burstable_item\" title=\"Best burstable item\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best burstable item.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Build_the_best_volcano\" title=\"Build the best volcano\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Build the best volcano.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Work_out_what_Alex_Horne_is_wearing_next_door\" title=\"Work out what Alex Horne is wearing next door\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Work out what Alex Horne is wearing next door. Both you and Alex must stay in your seats at all times. Alex Horne may only communicate with Alex Horne's horn.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Apologise_to_Alex_for_something_you%27ve_done\" title=\"Apologise to Alex for something you&#39;ve done\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Alex is in the living room. In 20 minutes from now, you must apologise to Alex for something you've done in that time.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_into_two_sleeping_bags_then_skip_once\" title=\"Get into two sleeping bags then skip once\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Get into one sleeping bag with your arms through the arm-holes, the zip zipped up and the hood on your head. Then stand to attention and salute the Taskmaster for a five full seconds. Then get into the other sleeping bag with your arms in the arm-holes, the zip zipped up and the hood on your head whilst still in your first sleeping bag. Then skip once.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ScoresS8E3&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ScoresS8E3-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ScoresS8E3&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ScoresS8E3-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>17<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ScoresS8E3&#95;1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ScoresS8E3-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td>10\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">19<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ScoresS8E3&#95;1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ScoresS8E3-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td>11\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"><b>Notes</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notes\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Stuck_in_a_mammal_groove.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notes\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<div class=\"references-small\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-ScoresS8E3-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-ScoresS8E3_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-ScoresS8E3_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-ScoresS8E3_1-2\">1.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-ScoresS8E3_1-3\">1.3</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Although Lou completed the task quicker than Iain, Iain was awarded the win, although Lou should have been awarded 5 points and Iain 4 points. The scores for the episode and total points for the series both reflect this unexplained change to the points awarded for this task.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Video\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"htt